## Chat UI Preferences
- Align bot messages to the left and user messages to the right.
- Use distinct bubble styles for bot and user messages, ensuring bubbles are rounded and animated.
- Implement entrance animations for messages.
- Ensure input and upload controls are rounded, centered, and have a maximum width of 360px.
- For select controls, prefer accenting with border/box-shadow on hover instead of changing the select background or styling `<option>` elements directly to avoid inverse/native OS rendering issues. Maintain consistent caret styling and prefer `appearance: none` on selects. Use accent-color (brand blue) for additional emphasis.